  "description": "When time is the only opponent, every detail counts. You need your head, your legs and a bike capable of turning all your energy into speed.\n\nYour body stretched forward, your gaze locked onto the horizon level with the handlebar aero extensions. Your legs driving you forward. Man and bicycle: the symbiosis of dynamism. The\nspeed soars, the aerodynamic flow gradually becomes heavier. The Turbine SLR captures the cyclist’s kinetic energy and transforms it into mechanical energy.\nThe middle and rear section of the frame have sleeker silhouettes than the previous generation of the product. The result? The frame is lighter by a generous 300 g. And less weight means better acceleration with every attack.\n\nThe Turbine SLR is the flagship of our Innovation Lab. CFD simulations, wind tunnel tests, velodrome tests, road tests, through to the début of the prototype at the individual time trial in Budapest at the 2022 Giro d’Italia beside the Astana team.",
